  "subject": "Session closeout: plugin-submission + renderer-move arc (2026-05-26 evening → 2026-05-29) — drove pre-submission sanity pass on catdef-plugin; caught + fixed the catdef.org-now-private listing-copy staleness via CA-016 (reference renderer source placement at catdef-spec/renderer/); drafted PRIVACY.md; supported PO through marketplace submission (now Submitted-and-pending-review at platform.claude.com); verified canonical-implementor's CA-016 renderer move; filed /fetch+ZIP observation which hit the option-c CA-NNN collision (CA-015 queue-vs-decision) and renumbered it to CA-017 + bumped counter directly via wrangler with PO; self-flagged a CA-015 doctrine violation (grep ~/.claude.json attempt); received CC on thingalog-ux-engineer design-mode routing (substrate-touching-vars channel established); cleaned feedback queue (CDF-0001/0002 rejected as early tests); received bucket now empty",

